&lt;li&gt;Oversee, maintain, and transform the current Employee Referral Program, leveraging data and automation to streamline payments, and drive better candidate quality and hiring outcomes.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Use data-driven insights to identify opportunities for process improvement and scalability across global hiring strategies&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Drive monthly prioritization and roadmap initiatives by translating problems into actionable project plans.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Respond to and resolve Tier 2 inquiries from employees regarding recruiting systems and processes.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Build and maintain strong cross-functional relationships to ensure alignment with stakeholders across Talent Acquisition and adjacent teams.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Facilitate workshops and meetings to drive consensus among internal stakeholders.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Create and maintain documentation to support TA processes and best practices.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What We Look For:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;

