&lt;p&gt;Providing great support to users of all sizes is culturally important to everyone at Stripe. We are a group of friendly, user-oriented engineers that partner closely with Stripe’s world-class design, product, and operational teams. This includes the external-facing support interfaces (&lt;a href=&quot;http://support.stripe.com&quot;&gt;support.stripe.com&lt;/a&gt;), content, entry points, internal tooling, case routing, and helping product teams across the company reduce support volume by improving our products. We are also using the latest generative AI technologies to re-imagine support experiences, and are developing AI assistants for Stripe’s users and internally to help our operations teams be more productive.&lt;/p&gt;
